vs

[Image/application/ImageService.java](https://github.com/kakao-tech-campus-2nd-step3/Team26_BE/pull/40/files#diff-6553d6c48e45dd84369bb41647ee7637db9367d2ae5390e3b30a9e74d3cd3d1d)
